<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"></head><body><div dir="auto"><p>Sounds good, <strong>see you there</strong>.</p><ol><li>bring slides</li><li>book room</li></ol><blockquote style="margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px solid #ccc;padding-left:1ex"><p>a quote</p></blockquote><pre><code>code block</code></pre><div class="gmail_quote"><div class="gmail_attr">On Tue, Nov 10, 2026 at 3:04 PM, Ada Example &lt;ada@example.com&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class="gmail_quote" style="margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px solid #ccc;padding-left:1ex"><div dir="ltr">Great, I'll bring the <b>slides</b>.<div><br></div><div>Two things:</div><ul><li>the venue is <a href="https://maps.example.com/venue" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">here</a></li><li>parking is free after 6</li></ul><div><br><div><br></div><span>-- </span><br><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr">Mo Example<div>Product, Example Labs</div></div></div></div></div><br><div><div dir="ltr">On Mon, Nov 9, 2026 at 4:20 PM Nia Example &lt;<a href="mailto:nia@example.com" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">nia@example.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 0.8ex; border-left: 1px solid rgb(204,204,204); padding-left: 1ex"><div dir="ltr">Can you present on Thursday?<br><div><div dir="ltr">On Mon, Nov 9, 2026 at 9:00 AM Mo Example &lt;<a href="mailto:mo@example.com" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">mo@example.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 0.8ex; border-left: 1px solid rgb(204,204,204); padding-left: 1ex">Happy to help with the meetup.</blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div>
</blockquote></div></div></body></html>
